## Principle

*Do not rewrite the doctrine — reference it. The client **declares** intent (active profile); the
server **confirms** against the roles actually granted and fails closed by default
(`modules/rbac-and-scoping.md`, `knowledge/origin-lessons.md`). Nothing in this document depends on
a check done only on the client.*

